{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>That is hunted.</b> I have only צַיִד — geese and chickens, from where? Scripture says ״צֵיד״ — from anywhere. If so, why does it say ״אֲשֶׁר יָצוּד״? That one should not eat meat except by such preparation (Ḥullin 4)." "<b>That may be eaten.</b> This excludes unclean species (ibid. 5)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:06:53.254444321Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}